{"title":"2004 Pan African MO Problems/Problem 2","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2004_Pan_African_MO_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/2/9/929e7490f85293c9011cc576c88a81b13793ad21.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4\\sqrt{4-2\\sqrt{3}}+\\sqrt{97-56\\sqrt{3}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -6px\" width=\"214\" height=\"32\" /> an integer?\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2004_Pan_African_MO_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/6/2/b623f92a5f0cb8376e979ef7058e4fa858eeb1de.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\sqrt{4-2\\sqrt{3}} = a\\sqrt{3}-b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -6px\" width=\"170\" height=\"32\" />. \nThrough guess and check with small numbers, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/8/d/48d02444a59b917b64e8bd0963b88712fc7fa0a3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a = 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"45\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/5/1/851b03ce92c3ad8da97daf2785cf4e103c7a8d66.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b = 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"40\" height=\"13\" />. \nSo <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/f/a/7fa91dd763f58ae1f53ed5cd2ea145f3b36dc671.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\sqrt{4-2\\sqrt{3}} = \\sqrt{3}-1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -6px\" width=\"161\" height=\"32\" />.  \n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/7/d/f7d6b4018c5f0a28b7a928f12cc5d0e7babe7fd3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\sqrt{97-56\\sqrt{3}} = a-b\\sqrt{3}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -6px\" width=\"189\" height=\"32\" />. \nThrough prime factorization, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/b/1/9b1838491bea2799f90f459e5a942e9dd6d7c4c7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a = 7$\" width=\"43\" height=\"12\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/b/5/7b536ddd9c1bc57b1c8d702f04513856a2f7a239.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b = -4$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"55\" height=\"13\" />. \nSo <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/a/5/9a51288dcc0b6127b9117feb3be249913a8bc904.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\sqrt{97-56\\sqrt{3}} = 7-4\\sqrt{3}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -6px\" width=\"190\" height=\"32\" />.\n</p><p>Value of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/2/3/023ad42f9f52d8fba3057c7d4e3795e3704ec757.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4\\sqrt{4-2\\sqrt{3}} + \\sqrt{97-56\\sqrt{3}} = (4\\sqrt{3}-4) + (7-4\\sqrt{3}) = 3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -6px\" width=\"451\" height=\"32\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2004_Pan_African_MO_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"clear:both; margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2004_Pan_African_MO\" title=\"2004 Pan African MO\">2004 Pan African MO</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2004_Pan_African_MO_Problems\" title=\"2004 Pan African MO Problems\">Problems</a></b>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"33%\" align=\"center\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2004_Pan_African_MO_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2004 Pan African MO Problems/Problem 1\">Problem 1</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"34%\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2004_Pan_African_MO_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2004 Pan African MO Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2004_Pan_African_MO_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"2004 Pan African MO Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2004_Pan_African_MO_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"2004 Pan African MO Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2004_Pan_African_MO_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"2004 Pan African MO Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2004_Pan_African_MO_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"2004 Pan African MO Problems/Problem 6\">6</a>\n</td>\n<td width=\"33%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2004_Pan_African_MO_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"2004 Pan African MO Problems/Problem 3\">Problem 3</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"center\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Pan_African_MO_Problems_and_Solutions\" title=\"Pan African MO Problems and Solutions\"> All Pan African MO Problems and Solutions</a></b>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261017110018\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.015 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.022 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 85/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 962/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 44/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 3/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 1946/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    9.235      1 Template:Pan_African_MO_box\n100.00%    9.235      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-